Subject: [PATCH] debian: package normal image colour as rogdv6

---
 debian/changelog | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index bc78859..4ec0f1d 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,14 @@
+gtk4 (4.24.1+ds-1+rogdv6) stonking; urgency=medium
+
+  * Negotiate precise normal Wayland colour descriptions using supported
+    v1/v2 transfer contracts without a debug opt-in.
+  * Preserve the target SDK layout with bounded opaque identity tokens and
+    both versions of preferred-description callbacks.
+  * Keep one Wayland description owner through supported Vulkan pass-through
+    and normal renderer fallback; retain the no-manager legacy path.
+
+ -- Codex contributors <codex@invalid>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:48:14 +0000
+
 gtk4 (4.24.1+ds-1+rogdv5) stonking; urgency=medium
 
   * Grade each retained GtkVideo picture to its declared HDR or SDR view.
